<title>JAPAN: Bunka Shutter rises in morning trade.</title>
<headline>Bunka Shutter rises in morning trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Bunka Shutter Co Ltd firmed in Thursday morning in heavy trading, propelled by buying aimed at adding profits to the firm's equity-related bonds, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0145 GMT, the share price was up two yen at 852 yen, on volume of 945,000 shares, marking the 19th heaviest trade in the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
